WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.767
A boarded-up opening becomes a lit glass storefront

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:09.533
A crane lifts a curtain-wall unit into an open bay

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:12.633
A pane is set on blocks and sealed into its frame

00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:17.400
Floors light up behind a finished curtain wall

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.567
A mirror-glass building reflects the moving sky
